[00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.880]   At Constellium, the health and safety
[00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.220]   of our employees is our first priority.
[00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:23.400]   We have implemented many initiatives to protect our employees
[00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.100]   in response to the COVID-19 pandemic.
[00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.260]   We have provided our personnel with personal protective equipment,
